"L" <L_1_L_0@yahoo.com> wrote:
>All sacrifices to your god reduce your god's anger.

This turns out not to be the case.  Sacrifices with a sacrificial value
of less than 8 (12 for chaotics) do nothing to reduce your god's anger
(since they are less than one-third or one-half, respectively, of the
"maximum" sacrifical value), resulting instead in the message "You have
a feeling of inadequacy."

If your god's anger has been reduced but not zeroed, you receive the
message "[godname] seems slightly mollified."

Now, all positive-value sacrifices *do* increase your alignment score,
but that's distinct from divine anger.
